{
  "_readme": "Words the on-device object detector (YOLOE) looks for. Edit this list, push, and GitHub rebuilds the detector with the new words (adds ~3–5 min to that one build). Use short, concrete nouns ('water bottle', not 'bottle of water on a table'). Keep 'person' and 'cell phone' (people counting and mirror detection use them). The food words used for the Food subject are listed in config.json → detection.foodObjectLabels.",
